  "narrative": "North Carolina opened Bill Belichick’s second season as head coach with a low-scoring, rain-affected win over TCU. The Tar Heels and Horned Frogs traded first-quarter scores, then UNC took the lead for good on a second-quarter safety and sealed the result with a third-quarter field goal. Neither team threw a touchdown pass. Kicking: Aeron Burrell (UNC) 2-for-3 FG (made 20, 28; missed 42), 1-for-1 XP. Kyle Lemmermann (TCU) 1-for-1 FG (31), 1-for-1 XP.",
